// Syncthing ignore patterns for the OpenClaw home folder (data/openclaw).
// Place this file as `.stignore` inside the synced folder on BOTH hosts.
//
// Principle: the Markdown memory is the source of truth and syncs.
// The SQLite index is derived and MUST NOT sync (live DB sync corrupts it) -
// the backup rebuilds it from the Markdown on promotion (AS-15).

// Derived search index and any SQLite state - never sync.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
memory/main.sqlite*

// Logs and scratch.
*.log
/logs
/tmp

// Secrets must never leave the host.
.env
.env.*

// OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
